WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.661
- Okay. So it's time to
introduce our first guest.

00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:03.750
And I don't know who it is.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.370
I hope they like margaritas in case,

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.060
and if they don't, leave.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.067
Please welcome the star

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:10.540
of one of my favorite shows on television.

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:12.712
Come on out, whoever you are.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:15.962
(upbeat music playing)

00:00:16.871 --> 00:00:19.621
(crowd cheering)

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:25.437
(upbeat music continues)

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:34.817
Oh my gosh.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.500
So basically, I'm on a date
drinking with Nathan Fillion.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.780
That's what's happening, I'm just kidding.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:41.613
- Are you surprised?

00:00:41.613 --> 00:00:44.480
- I am, I had no, I literally
have nothing, no idea.

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.020
- We wanted to surprise you.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.170
- Okay, okay.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.320
- But I didn't want this
to be the only surprise.

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.280
- Oh it's enough.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.286
- Can I bring some more?

00:00:51.286 --> 00:00:52.119
- Oh yeah.

00:00:52.119 --> 00:00:53.270
Oh, are you? Please say, okay.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:55.060
- I want to you guys to all welcome,

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:57.134
please welcome, Mekia Cox.

00:00:57.134 --> 00:00:58.130
- Yes.

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:01.334
- Melissa Diaz, Melissa
O'Neil and Eric Winter.

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:02.521
(crowd cheering)

00:01:02.521 --> 00:01:05.771
(upbeat music playing)

00:01:14.962 --> 00:01:16.629
- How are you doing?

00:01:20.256 --> 00:01:23.006
(crowd cheering)

